@startuml lld-us1-activity
title LLD-US1 Log in with customer ID and password: activity diagram
skinparam monochrome true
start
:Read customer ID and password;
if (Password matches?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Increase failed count, show error;
  stop
endif
:Create pre-session;
:Open OTP page;
stop
@enduml